				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "13cd4d25-a2df-403d-9b62-4009dc6eeb04")
	)
	(text "Per channel (TI ADS1118 Fig. 50, bias raised to 10M): RDIFF 536R in each lead, RPU 10M AIN+ -> +3V3A,\nRPD 10M AIN- -> GND (bias and open-thermocouple detection), CCM 100n each input -> GND, CDIFF 1u across.\nSocket pin 1 = +, pin 2 = -, MP = mounting bracket on the isothermal copper (GND). The sockets and both\nADS1118 sit on the isothermal island (Layout in docs/design.md). FSR +-0.256 V, internal temperature\nsensor = cold junction."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "16ee0500-6e46-455a-8193-bd3fff19d099")
	)
